SUMMARY:Give Thanks with $39 Lobster Pad Thai Dinner incl. Dessert (Greenw
 ood Station)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**On Sunday\, October 11th\, join us for D
 inner with $39 Lobster Pad Thai or Lobster Khao Soi and Dessert\, or choos
 e from the a la carte menu and prices.** This is one of my favourite resta
 urants that I have been going to for years. SALA Thai Kitchen is where aut
 hentic Thai flavours meet warm hospitality. Every dish is made from scratc
 h — fresh herbs\, real chilies\, and family recipes Chef Mo learned in K
 oh Samui. Bold\, balanced\, and proudly Thai — no ketchup\, ever.....\n\
 n**Chef Mo is saying Happy Thanksgiving with this special:**\n**Lobster Pa
 d Thai or Lobster Khao Soi\, $39** (regular $55) with a complimentary dess
 ert.\nOR\n**Lobster Family Set $75**\nOne Lobster Khao Soi\, one Lobster P
 ad Thai\, one appetizer and one dessert of your choice.\n\n**COST**\nOrgan
 izer Meetup fee: $5\n\nFor tables of 6+\, there will be an automatic gratu
 ity.\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* RSVP Yes. Everyone goes on the waitlist until 
 they have reserved their seat\, with an etransfer of $15 (includes $5 meet
 up fee). Attendees will receive back $10 the day after the event.\n* Once 
 you are on the waitlist\, I will message you the email address for the etr
 ansfer.\n* Once the transfer is complete\, I will move you to attending. T
 here are no refunds for any reason.\n* A reminder will be sent the night b
 efore with my cell and all meetup details. Make sure you set up your commu
 nication settings to receive.\n\nRSVPs close the Wed. prior. Cancellations
  will result in a No Show and impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**
 \n**Meet me at: 7pm inside the front doors of Sala Thai Restaurant at 1262
  Danforth Ave.** Please wait for me to arrive\, and do not sit on your own
  prior\, so we can get the table requested.\n\nLength: 1.5 - 2 hours\n\nEn
 joy and please post your Comments in the event after.
