SUMMARY:Sense and Sensibility + Dinner (Bay Station confirmed)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Friday October 16th\,** join me to se
 e **Sense and Sensibility\,** an irresistible new take on Jane Austen's ic
 onic book... a charming\, witty\, and deeply relatable story of love and s
 isterhood starring Daisy Edgar-Jones and Esmé Creed-Miles. **My seat is K
 21. Purchase your ticket for Sense and Sensibility on Friday October 16th 
 for the Regular Show at 6:50pm at Cineplex Varsity.**\n\n**COST**\nAdult $
 16.75/ Cineclub $10.99/ Senior $12 + taxes\n\n**SIGNING UP**\n\n* **Simply
  RSVP Yes confirming Yes/No to food/drinks after**\n* **[Purchase](https:/
 /www.cineplex.com/en/movie/sense-and-sensibility-2026) your own ticket by 
 selecting Get Advance Tickets\, Friday October 16th\, Varsity Cinema\, Reg
 ular Show at 6:50pm\, and post your seat number as a Comment**\n* You can 
 also meet the group at the meetup time with your ticket in hand\n* RSVPs c
 lose 1 day prior\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 6:40pm in front of Audi
 torium 2\, inside Cineplex Varsity at 55 Bloor St. W. after scanning your 
 ticket**\n\n**Show starts**: **6:50PM**\n\nLength: 2 hours 12 minutes\n\nA
 fter: meet me outside **Auditorium 2** to head out for dinner and chat abo
 ut the movie\n\nEnjoy and please post your comments in the event after.
