SUMMARY:Impressionist Afternoon Tea + 3 Exhibits at the AGO
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Sunday\, October 18th**\, join me for
  an **Impressionist Afternoon Tea in the Norma Ridley Members’ Lounge to
  celebrate the connection between art\, atmosphere and indulgence.** Inspi
 red by the luminous colours and expressive brushstrokes of *[Impressionist
  Revolution: Monet to Matisse from the Dallas Museum of Art](https://ago.c
 a/exhibitions/impressionist-revolution-monet-matisse-dallas-museum-art)* w
 e saw last month\, this seasonal Afternoon Tea offers an elegant\, leisure
 ly escape into art\, conversation and thoughtfully crafted flavours that r
 eflect the beauty and softness of this exhibit. Delicate savoury selection
 s and whimsical pastries are designed to evoke sunlit gardens\, countrysid
 e picnics and the romance of Impressionism. Since Afternoon Tea includes f
 ree admission to the Gallery\, we will see more Impressionism art that was
  not part of our August visit - **Reality & Reverie: Canadian and European
  Painting Beyond Impressionism**\, **Steam: Impressionist Painting Across 
 the Atlantic**\, and a new exhibit that will open the day before - **In Pl
 ain Sight: Highlights from the AGO’s Collection of Historic Picture Fram
 es**. **I** **have booked a table for Sunday October 18th at 2:30pm\, and 
 can add members to it.**\n\n**COST**\nAdult: $80 + taxes + gratuity = $104
 .80\n\nMeetup Organizer Fee: $5\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP Yes** **\\- 
 everyone goes on the waitlist until confirmed\\.**\n* **I will reach out t
 o provide my email address for the etransfer of $109.80 and I will call in
  to add you to our table. Once I receive confirmation\, I will inform you 
 and move you to attending.**\n* There are no refunds.\n\nA reminder will b
 e sent the day before with my cell and reminder details where to meet and 
 when.\n\nRSVPs close 3 days prior and the Waitlist will be removed at that
  time. Cancellations will result in a No Show and impact future attendance
 .\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 1:45pm inside the entrance to the righ
 t side of the AGO at 317 Dundas St. W. We will then scan our tickets and h
 ead over to the exhibits\, prior to Tea.**\n\n**Note: We must enter the AG
 O together for our tea reservation.**\n\n**EXHIBITS**\n**Reality & Reverie
 : Canadian and European Painting Beyond Impressionism** (Level 1 Gallery 1
 27)\n\n**Steam: Impressionist Painting Across the Atlantic** (Level 1 Gall
 ery 116)\n\n**Highlights from the AGO’s Collection of Historic Picture F
 rames** (Level 1 Gallery 115)\n\n**Meet me for Afternoon Tea: at 2:30pm in
  front of the** **Norma Ridley Members’ Lounge (Level 1)** (Please do no
 t go to our table before I get there)\n\nEnjoy and please post your commen
 ts in the Event after.
