SUMMARY:Virtual World Ballet Day 2026: How Stories are Made
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: You can come and go any time throu
 ghout the event and I recommend casting to your TV**\n\n**A global celebra
 tion of dance\, World Ballet Day returns Thursday\, October 29\, 2026** (f
 rom Wednesday\, October 28th through October 29th EDT). This year’s them
 e explores storytelling\, both onstage and behind the scenes\, and the pre
 paration that makes creation possible. **World Ballet Day** is an annual c
 elebration of [ballet](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ballet "Ballet") held
  since 2014 in October or November. It is a collaboration between major [b
 allet companies](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ballet_company "Ballet comp
 any") around the world\, which stream live video of their behind-the-scene
 s preparations in their respective time zones\, with the lead co-producer 
 being the Royal Opera House\, Covent Garden\, London.\n\nThis year\, **The
  National Ballet of Canada** will offer a behind-the-scenes look at the cr
 eation of *The Beginning of Forever* by Resident Choreographer **David Daw
 son**\, which will have its world wide premiere next June. (An event will 
 be posted). Through in-depth interviews\, discover how Dawson creates the 
 space for collaboration and brings a new work to the stage\, working along
 side composer **Peter Gregson**\, Music Director and Principal Conductor *
 *David Briskin** and Artistic Director **Hope Muir**. The National Ballet 
 will also unveil the premiere of a stunning film of Dawson's international
 ly celebrated pas de deux *On the Nature of Daylight*\, directed by **Derr
 ick Belcham**\, featuring Principal Dancers **Genevieve Penn Nabity** and 
 **Ben Rudisin**.\n\nBallet companies worldwide will stream and share conte
 nt from their individual platforms.\nPlease click on the names below to vi
 sit each company’s website and find out more about their activity for Wo
 rld Ballet Day 2026: How Stories Are Made. Programs are yet to be announce
 d.\n\n[Royal Academy of Dance](https://www.royalacademyofdance.org/)\n[The
  Royal Ballet](https://www.rbo.org.uk/production/world-ballet-day)\n[The R
 oyal Ballet Schoo](https://www.royalballetschool.org.uk/)l\n[The National 
 Ballet of Canada](https://national.ballet.ca/worldballetday)\n[The Austral
 ian Ballet](https://australianballet.com.au/)\n[San Francisco Ballet](http
 s://www.sfballet.org/)\n[English National Ballet](https://www.ballet.org.u
 k/)\n[The Royal Danish Ballet](https://www.kglteater.dk/)\n[Royal New Zeal
 and Ballet](https://rnzb.org.nz/)\n[Sacramento Ballet](https://www.sacball
 et.org/)\n[São Paulo Dance Company](https://www.spcd.com.br/)\n[Smuin Con
 temporary Ballet](https://www.smuinballet.org/)\n[Staatsballett Hannover](
 https://staatstheater-hannover.de/de_DE/staatsballett-hannover?keyword=all
 )\n[Stuttgart Ballet](https://www.stuttgart-ballet.de/)\n[Sydney Dance Com
 pany](https://www.sydneydancecompany.com/)\n[Teatro alla Scala](https://ww
 w.teatroallascala.org/)\n[Vienna State Ballet](https://www.wiener-staatsba
 llett.at/)\n[Dutch National Ballet](https://www.operaballet.nl/)\n[Finnish
  National Ballet](https://oopperabaletti.fi/en/)\n[Les Grands Ballets](htt
 ps://grandsballets.com/fr/)\n[ISTD](https://www.istd.org/home/)\n[Nashvill
 e Ballet](https://www.nashvilleballet.com/)\n[The National Ballet of Japan
 ](https://www.nntt.jac.go.jp/english/lp/nbj/)\n[Northern Ballet](https://n
 orthernballet.com/)\n[Norwegian National Ballet](https://www.operaen.no/)\
 n[Opéra national de Paris](https://www.operadeparis.fr/)\n[Orlando Ballet
 ](https://orlandoballet.org/)\n[Pacific Northwest Ballet](https://www.pnb.
 org/)\n[Polish National Ballet](https://teatrwielki.pl/en/polish-national-
 ballet/)\n[Acosta Dance Foundation](https://acostadancefoundation.org.uk/)
 \n[Alonzo King LINES Ballet](https://linesballet.org/)\n[American Ballet T
 heatre](https://www.abt.org/)\n[Ballet Concierto de Puerto Rico](https://w
 ww.balletconcierto.com/)\n[Ballet Indonesia Foundation](https://www.ballet
 .id/)\n[Ballet Lubbock](https://balletlubbock.org/in-the-community/)\n[Bal
 letMet](https://www.balletmet.org/)\n[Les Ballets de Monte-Carlo](https://
 www.balletsdemontecarlo.com/fr/saison-2026-2027)\n[Bangkok City Ballet](ht
 tps://bangkokcityballet.com/)\n[Birmingham Royal Ballet](https://www.brb.o
 rg.uk/)\n[Boston Ballet](https://www.bostonballet.org/)\n[Cape Town City B
 allet NPC](https://capetowncityballet.org.za/)\n[Dance Theatre of Harlem](
 https://www.dancetheatreofharlem.org/)\n[Cloud Gate Dance Theatre of Taiwa
 n](https://www.instagram.com/cloudgatedance)\n\n**COST**\nFree\n\n**SIGNIN
 G UP**\n\n* Simply RSVP Yes\n* Click on any of Ballet company of interest 
 above to see their stores and content\n* **Start time: I will open this up
  at 7pm for the international countries\; other countries may not open unt
 il Oct 29th**\n* Length: as you wish\n* RSVPs close 1 hour prior to start 
 time\n\nEnjoy and please post your Comments after!
