SUMMARY:Free - Soundstreams Violins Unbound (Broadview Ave)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: In addition to RSVPing Yes\, you n
 eed to register for your free admission to this concert\, which will sell 
 out.**\n\nOn **Monday November 2nd\, attend** **Violins Unbound** **for TD
  Encounters Soundstreams.** Few instruments can match the violin’s extra
 ordinary combination of brilliance\, agility\, and expressive power. This 
 Encounters event will showcase all that the violin can offer\, featuring v
 iolinists **Judith Fliedl**\, visiting from Austria on a Canadian tour\, a
 nd Toronto-based violinist **Roan Ma**\, performing a world premiere for v
 iolin duet by **André Ristic**\, commissioned by Soundstreams. The progra
 m will also include works by **John Beckwith**\, **Chris Paul Harman**\, *
 *Parisa Sabet**\, **Ana Sokolović**. A discussion and audience Q&A with F
 liedl and Ma will follow the performance. **Register for your free admissi
 on to Violins Unbound** **for TD Encounters Soundstream on Monday November
  2nd at 7:30pm.**\n\n**COST**\nTicket: Free\n\nMeetup Organizer Fee: $5\n\
 n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP Yes**\n* **[Register](https://soundstreams.ca/
 events/td-encounters-violins-unbound-2/)\, post you have registered for fr
 ee admission**\, and I will move you to going.\n\nA reminder will be sent 
 the day before with my cell and reminder details where to meet and when.\n
 \nRSVPs close 2 days prior hoping there are still spots available. The Wai
 tlist will be removed at that time. Cancellations will result in a No Show
  and impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 6:45pm in
 side Hugh's Room at 296 Broadview Ave.**\n\n**Start: 7:30pm**\n\nLength: 1
  - 2 hours\n\nAfter: meet at the same spot to chat about the show\n\nEnjoy
  and please post your comments in the Event after.
